Download and share files over BitTorrent

Transmission is a lightweight BitTorrent client that downloads torrents and magnet links without getting in your way. It uses little memory and CPU, has sensible defaults, and can also be controlled from a browser or another computer.

- Open torrent files and magnet links, and create your own torrents
- Choose which files in a torrent to download, and in what order
- Set speed limits, with a schedule for slower alternative limits
- Encryption, peer exchange, DHT, local peer discovery and UPnP port forwarding
- Control it remotely through the built-in web interface
